[h1]Zorn Mission Utility Mod[/h1]

A collection of frameworks, tools and utilities for mission makers - originally built for our unit, cleaned up for public use.

[b]⚠️ Important:[/b] There are no modules and no "easy setup." Basic knowledge of Arma 3 config and SQF is required to get the most out of this mod. These addons were made to solve my own problems — happy to help with details, but basic SQF/config understanding is expected.

[h2]Feature Highlights[/h2]
[list]
[*] Role & SteamID based Arsenal Framework
[*] Custom Supply Crate Framework (WIP)
[*] Intel System
[*] and more!
[/list]

[h2]Dependencies[/h2]
[list]
[*] CBA
[*] ACE3
[/list]

[b]Server Admins:[/b] This mod must be loaded on both server and client.

